BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 60 780 Td (Incident 2025-031 Postmortem: Checkout outage) Tj T* () Tj T* (Summary: On 14 March 2025 checkout was unavailable for 47 minutes. Customers saw) Tj T* (HTTP 503 errors when placing orders. The incident was classified SEV1.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Root cause: orders-svc v3.8.1 exhausted its database connection pool after a) Tj T* (change that held connections open while calling the payments service. The pool) Tj T* (maximum was 20 connections per pod, and slow payment authorizations kept every) Tj T* (connection busy.) Tj T* ET
